---
import {
  residualFourierTail,
  cutoffForTail,
} from '../../../data/part03/ch11TeachingModels.mjs';

const defaultRc = 1.8;
const tolerance = 1e-6;
const defaultCutoff = cutoffForTail(defaultRc, tolerance);
const qMax = 6;
const points = Array.from({ length: 401 }, (_, index) => {
  const q = qMax * index / 400;
  return { q, tail: residualFourierTail(defaultRc, q) };
});
const x = (q) => 62 + q / qMax * 668;
const y = (tail) => 35 + (-Math.log10(Math.max(tail, 1e-12)) / 12) * 245;
const path = points.map((point, index) => `${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${x(point.q).toFixed(2)} ${y(point.tail).toFixed(2)}`).join(' ');
---

<figure class="chapter-visual hardness-explorer" data-hardness-explorer>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创 Fourier-tail 模型：芯半径与“硬度” | Original Fourier-tail model: core radius and hardness</strong>
    <span>用解析高频尾代理说明更短的光滑长度通常需要更大的倒空间范围。该图不预测任何真实赝势的推荐截断。</span>
    <span lang="en">An analytic high-frequency-tail proxy illustrates why a shorter smoothing length generally requires a wider reciprocal-space range. It does not predict a recommended cutoff for any real pseudopotential.</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="chapter-visual__controls">
    <label>
      <span>模型芯半径 | Model core radius r_c: <output data-rc-output>1.8</output> Bohr</span>
      <input data-rc type="range" min="0.8" max="3.0" step="0.1" value="1.8" aria-label="Model core radius for Fourier-tail proxy" />
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>尾部容差 | Tail tolerance</span>
      <select data-tolerance aria-label="Fourier-tail tolerance">
        <option value="0.0001">10^-4</option>
        <option value="0.000001" selected>10^-6</option>
        <option value="0.00000001">10^-8</option>
      </select>
    </label>
  </div>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 760 330" role="img" aria-labelledby="hardness-title hardness-desc">
    <title id="hardness-title">Fourier-tail proxy versus reciprocal cutoff</title>
    <desc id="hardness-desc">The logarithm of an analytic reciprocal-space tail for an adjustable core radius, plotted from zero at the top to minus twelve at the bottom.</desc>
    <line class="plot-axis" x1="62" y1="280" x2="730" y2="280" />
    <line class="plot-axis" x1="62" y1="35" x2="62" y2="280" />
    <line class="plot-axis" x1="56" y1="35" x2="62" y2="35" />
    <line class="plot-axis" x1="56" y1="157.5" x2="62" y2="157.5" />
    <line class="plot-axis" x1="56" y1="280" x2="62" y2="280" />
    <text x="52" y="40" text-anchor="end">0</text>
    <text x="52" y="162.5" text-anchor="end">−6</text>
    <text x="52" y="285" text-anchor="end">−12</text>
    <line class="plot-guide" data-tolerance-line x1="62" y1={y(tolerance)} x2="730" y2={y(tolerance)} />
    <line class="plot-guide" data-cutoff-line x1={x(defaultCutoff)} y1="35" x2={x(defaultCutoff)} y2="280" />
    <path class="hardness-explorer__curve" data-tail-curve d={path} />
    <text x="396" y="322" text-anchor="middle">q (Bohr⁻¹)</text>
    <text x="17" y="158" transform="rotate(-90 17 158)" text-anchor="middle">log10 tail</text>
  </svg>

  <p class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span>达到容差所需 q_c：<strong data-q-cut>{defaultCutoff.toFixed(4)}</strong> Bohr⁻¹</span>
    <span>动能代理 q_c²/2：<strong data-energy-cut>{(defaultCutoff ** 2 / 2).toFixed(4)}</strong> Ha</span>
    <span>r_c q_c：<strong data-product>{(defaultRc * defaultCutoff).toFixed(6)}</strong></span>
  </p>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong>归一化尾部取 <code>T(q)=exp[-(r_c q)²]</code>。给定容差 τ 时，<code>q_c=sqrt(-ln τ)/r_c</code>。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> the normalized tail is <code>T(q)=exp[-(r_c q)²]</code>. For tolerance τ, <code>q_c=sqrt(-ln τ)/r_c</code>.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>固定容差下 r_c q_c 保持常数；r_c 减半时 q_c 加倍，动能代理增加四倍；纵轴必须把 log10 T=0 放在顶部、−12 放在底部，使尾部随 q 增大向下衰减。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> r_c q_c remains constant at fixed tolerance; halving r_c doubles q_c and quadruples the kinetic-energy proxy; the vertical axis must place log10 T=0 at the top and −12 at the bottom so the tail decays downward as q increases.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>真实 hardness 由赝波函数、各通道、局域分量、增广电荷和目标 observable 共同决定，不能由单一芯半径公式给出。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> real hardness depends on pseudo-wavefunctions, channels, local component, augmentation charge, and the target observable; it cannot be inferred from one core-radius formula.</p>
  </div>

  <noscript>
    <p>无 JavaScript 时显示 r_c=1.8 Bohr、容差 10^-6 的解析尾部和截断代理。</p>
  </noscript>
</figure>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-hardness-explorer]').forEach((root) => {
    const rcInput = root.querySelector('[data-rc]');
    const toleranceInput = root.querySelector('[data-tolerance]');
    const update = () => {
      const rc = Number(rcInput.value);
      const tolerance = Number(toleranceInput.value);
      const qMax = 6;
      const count = 500;
      const x = (q) => 62 + q / qMax * 668;
      const y = (tail) => 35 + (-Math.log10(Math.max(tail, 1e-12)) / 12) * 245;
      const path = Array.from({ length: count + 1 }, (_, index) => {
        const q = qMax * index / count;
        const tail = Math.exp(-((rc * q) ** 2));
        return `${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${x(q).toFixed(2)} ${y(tail).toFixed(2)}`;
      }).join(' ');
      const qCut = Math.sqrt(-Math.log(tolerance)) / rc;
      root.querySelector('[data-tail-curve]').setAttribute('d', path);
      const toleranceY = y(tolerance);
      const toleranceLine = root.querySelector('[data-tolerance-line]');
      toleranceLine.setAttribute('y1', String(toleranceY));
      toleranceLine.setAttribute('y2', String(toleranceY));
      const cutoffX = x(Math.min(qCut, qMax));
      const cutoffLine = root.querySelector('[data-cutoff-line]');
      cutoffLine.setAttribute('x1', String(cutoffX));
      cutoffLine.setAttribute('x2', String(cutoffX));
      root.querySelector('[data-rc-output]').textContent = rc.toFixed(1);
      root.querySelector('[data-q-cut]').textContent = qCut.toFixed(4);
      root.querySelector('[data-energy-cut]').textContent = (qCut ** 2 / 2).toFixed(4);
      root.querySelector('[data-product]').textContent = (rc * qCut).toFixed(6);
    };
    rcInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    toleranceInput.addEventListener('change', update);
    update();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .hardness-explorer select { min-height: 2.25rem; }
  .hardness-explorer svg { width: 100%; min-height: 17rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
  .hardness-explorer svg text { fill: currentColor; font-size: 13px; }
  .hardness-explorer__curve { fill: none; stroke: var(--sl-color-accent-high); stroke-width: 3; }
</style>